---
import {coreweaveValue,cwPresets} from '../../lib/coreweave-valuation';
interface Props {language?:'ko'|'en'}
const {language='ko'}=Astro.props;const ko=language==='ko';const b=coreweaveValue(cwPresets.base);
const fields=[
 ['margin',ko?'백로그 현금흐름 마진':'Backlog cash margin',0,40,1,20,'%'],
 ['discount',ko?'할인율':'Discount rate',8,18,.5,12,'%'],
 ['prepaid',ko?'백로그 기수취 대금 · 가정':'Assumed collected prepayments',0,15,.5,5,'B'],
 ['eligible',ko?'재계약 대상 · 기존 백로그 중복 제외':'Eligible renewal fraction',0,100,5,65,'%'],
 ['utilization',ko?'재계약 유료 가동률':'Paid GPU utilization',0,100,5,70,'%'],
 ['hourly',ko?'GPU 시간당 실현 임대료 · 가정':'Realized hourly rent / GPU',0,8,.25,2.5,'$/h'],
 ['renewalMargin',ko?'재계약 현금흐름 마진':'Renewal cash margin',0,80,5,40,'%'],
 ['renewalYears',ko?'재계약 지속 기간':'Renewal cash-flow years',1,6,1,3,ko?'년':'years'],
 ['annualCapex',ko?'연간 신규 투자 · 백로그 외':'Annual incremental investment',0,40,1,20,'B'],
 ['cashYield',ko?'투자액 대비 연간 무차입 현금유입':'Annual unlevered inflow / investment',0,70,1,38,'%'],
 ['cohortLife',ko?'신규 투자 코호트 현금유입 기간':'New cohort cash-flow years',1,8,1,5,ko?'년':'years'],
 ['cohortCount',ko?'신규 투자 코호트 수':'New investment cohorts',0,10,1,6,ko?'개':'cohorts'],
 ['terminalFcf',ko?'2035년 이후 미모델 사업 연간 현금흐름':'2035 unmodeled annual free cash flow',0,20,.5,5,'B'],
 ['terminalGrowth',ko?'이후 영구 성장률':'Terminal growth rate',0,4,.5,2,'%'],
 ['shares',ko?'주식수 대용치':'Proxy shares',550,700,1,559,'M']
] as const;
---
<section class="lab" data-cw-lab data-language={language} aria-label={ko?'CoreWeave 코호트 모델':'CoreWeave cohort model'}>
<p class="kicker">THE ARCHIVE / COHORT VALUATION LAB</p><h3>{ko?'백로그에서 주주가치까지':'From backlog to equity value'}</h3>
<p>{ko?'실제 계약별 정보가 공개되지 않아 모든 가격·가동률·투자 수익성은 가정입니다. 모델 바깥 사업가치는 별도 항목으로 역산합니다.':'Contract-level terms are not disclosed; prices, utilization and investment returns are assumptions. Value outside modeled cohorts is solved separately.'}</p>
<div class="buttons"><button data-preset="bear">Bear</button><button data-preset="base" aria-pressed="true">Base</button><button data-preset="bull">Bull</button></div>
<div class="results" aria-live="polite"><div><span>{ko?'기존 백로그':'Existing backlog'}</span><strong data-out="backlog">${b.backlog.toFixed(2)}B</strong></div><div><span>{ko?'GPU 재계약':'GPU renewals'}</span><strong data-out="renewal">${b.renewal.toFixed(2)}B</strong></div><div><span>{ko?'신규 투자 NPV':'New investment NPV'}</span><strong data-out="newInvestment">${b.newInvestment.toFixed(2)}B</strong></div><div><span>{ko?'가정 기준 전체 주당 가치':'Illustrative fair value / share'}</span><strong data-out="fairPrice">${b.fairPrice.toFixed(2)}</strong></div></div>
<p class="note">{ko?'기준 종가 $60.77 · 2026-11-11. 부채·현금은 2026-09-30 기준. 이후 종가는 위 차트에서 확인합니다.':'Reference close $60.77 on 2026-11-11; debt and cash are as of 2026-09-30. See the chart above for later closes.'}</p>
<div class="grid"><div><h4>{ko?'가정 조정':'Assumptions'}</h4>{fields.map(([name,label,min,max,step,value,unit])=><label><span>{label}<output data-value={name}>{value}{unit}</output></span><input name={name} type="range" min={min} max={max} step={step} value={value} /></label>)}</div><div class="bridge" aria-live="polite"><h4>{ko?'가치 연결':'Value bridge'}</h4><dl><div><dt>{ko?'백로그 매출 PV':'Backlog revenue PV'}</dt><dd data-out="pvRevenue">${b.pvRevenue.toFixed(2)}B</dd></div><div><dt>{ko?'기수취 대금 PV':'PV of prior collections'}</dt><dd data-out="pvPrepaid">${b.pvPrepaid.toFixed(2)}B</dd></div><div><dt>{ko?'모형 내 가치 합계 − 순차입금':'Modeled value less net debt'}</dt><dd data-out="partialEquity">${b.partialEquity.toFixed(2)}B</dd></div><div><dt>{ko?'모형에 포함된 부분의 주당 가치':'Modeled partial value per share'}</dt><dd data-out="partialPerShare">${b.partialPerShare.toFixed(2)}</dd></div><div><dt>{ko?'2035년 이후 별도 사업 PV':'PV of separate business from 2035'}</dt><dd data-out="terminalValue">${b.terminalValue.toFixed(2)}B</dd></div><div><dt>{ko?'기준가에 필요한 미모델 순가치':'Unmodeled net value required'}</dt><dd data-out="requiredResidual2">${b.requiredResidual.toFixed(2)}B</dd></div></dl><p>{ko?'부분 주당 가치는 전체 가치가 아닙니다. 전체 주당 가치는 추가 지속사업 가정에 의존합니다. 미모델 가치는 추가 미래 코호트·잔존가치·미포함 청구권의 순액입니다. 음수라면 입력 가정의 모형 내 가치가 기준가를 초과한다는 뜻입니다.':'Partial value is not fair value; the whole-company estimate depends on the additional ongoing-business assumption. The residual is net of future cohorts, residual values and excluded claims; a negative residual indicates the modeled inputs exceed the reference value.'}</p></div></div>
<p class="note">{ko?'기존 코호트의 재계약 대상 비율은 이미 백로그에 포함된 용량과의 중복을 제거하기 위한 가정입니다. 2027·2028 계약종료 GPU의 수금은 편의상 각각 2028·2029부터 시작합니다. 신규 코호트는 2028년부터 해마다 투자하고 다음 해부터 수금하며, 백로그와 재계약을 중복하지 않는다고 가정합니다. 신규 투자의 현금유입률에는 운영비·세금·유지투자가 포함되지만 최초 투자비는 별도 차감됩니다. 기존 코호트 잔존가치는 0입니다. 2035년부터 기존 코호트와 겹치지 않는 별도 사업이 만드는 투자 후 연간 현금흐름을 영구 성장시키는 가정을 추가합니다. 주식수는 3분기 가중평균 대용치이며 전환 희석·미지급 자본비용은 완전 반영되지 않았습니다.':'The eligible fraction excludes assumed overlap with backlog. Renewal cash starts in 2028 and 2029 for the 2027 and 2028 cohorts. New investments begin in 2028 with receipts the following year and must not overlap backlog or renewals. Cash yield is after operating costs, tax and maintenance, before financing; initial investment is subtracted separately. Existing cohort salvage is zero. From 2035, separately modeled business creates an assumed perpetual post-investment cash flow with no overlap. Shares are a quarterly average proxy; dilution and capital payables are incomplete.'}</p>
</section>
<script>
import {coreweaveValue,cwPresets,type CoreWeaveInputs} from '../../lib/coreweave-valuation';
document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-cw-lab]').forEach(root=>{const names=['margin','discount','prepaid','eligible','utilization','hourly','renewalMargin','renewalYears','annualCapex','cashYield','cohortLife','cohortCount','terminalFcf','terminalGrowth','shares'] as const;const input=(n:string)=>root.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>(`input[name="${n}"]`)!;const write=(n:string,v:number,dollar=true)=>{const e=root.querySelector<HTMLElement>(`[data-out="${n}"]`);if(e)e.textContent=`${v<0?'−':''}$${Math.abs(v).toFixed(2)}${dollar?'B':''}`;};const render=()=>{const i={...cwPresets.base,...Object.fromEntries(names.map(n=>[n,Number(input(n).value)]))} as CoreWeaveInputs;const x=coreweaveValue(i);for(const n of names){const e=root.querySelector<HTMLOutputElement>(`[data-value="${n}"]`);if(e){const units:Record<string,string>={margin:'%',discount:'%',prepaid:'B',eligible:'%',utilization:'%',hourly:'$/h',renewalMargin:'%',renewalYears:'yr',annualCapex:'B',cashYield:'%',cohortLife:'yr',cohortCount:'',terminalFcf:'B',terminalGrowth:'%',shares:'M'};e.value=String(i[n])+units[n];}}for(const n of ['backlog','renewal','newInvestment','requiredResidual','pvRevenue','pvPrepaid','partialEquity','terminalValue'] as const)write(n,x[n]);write('partialPerShare',x.partialPerShare,false);write('fairPrice',x.fairPrice,false);write('requiredResidual2',x.requiredResidual);};root.querySelectorAll<HTMLInputElement>('input').forEach(e=>e.addEventListener('input',()=>{root.querySelectorAll('button[data-preset]').forEach(b=>b.setAttribute('aria-pressed','false'));render()}));root.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('button[data-preset]').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>{const p=cwPresets[b.dataset.preset as keyof typeof cwPresets];for(const n of names)input(n).value=String(p[n]);root.querySelectorAll('button[data-preset]').forEach(x=>x.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(x===b)));render()}));render();});
</script>
<style>
.lab{max-width:100%;margin:2rem 0;padding:clamp(1rem,3vw,1.8rem);border:1px solid #cbd6e4;border-radius:16px;background:#f5f8fc;color:#24324a;font-family:var(--sans)}.lab *{box-sizing:border-box;min-width:0}.kicker{font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#50749a}.buttons{display:flex;gap:.5rem;margin:1rem 0}.buttons button{padding:.5rem .9rem;border:1px solid #9db0c6;border-radius:8px;background:#fff;color:#24324a;cursor:pointer}.buttons [aria-pressed=true]{background:#234b70;color:#fff}.results{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:.5rem}.results>div,.grid>div{padding:.8rem;border:1px solid #d0d8e5;border-radius:10px;background:#fff}.results span{display:block;font-size:.75rem}.results strong{display:block;font-size:1.3rem;margin:.4rem 0}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:.7rem}.grid label{display:block;margin:1rem 0;font-size:.8rem;font-weight:700}.grid label span{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:.6rem}.grid input{width:100%;accent-color:#426f9c}.bridge dl>div{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:.5rem;border-bottom:1px solid #dce4ed;padding:.5rem 0;font-size:.8rem}.bridge dd{margin:0;font-weight:700}.bridge p,.note{font-size:.75rem;line-height:1.6}@media(max-width:700px){.results{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}:global(html.dark) .lab{background:#1d2632;color:#edf2f9;border-color:#48566b}:global(html.dark) .results>div,:global(html.dark) .grid>div{background:#263342;border-color:#48566b}:global(html.dark) .buttons button{background:#263342;color:#edf2f9}:global(html.dark) .buttons [aria-pressed=true]{background:#426f9c}
</style>
